---
// DesignSystem.astro
---
<section id="design-section" class="scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="border-b border-borderSubtle pb-4 mb-6">
    <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-sageGreen uppercase tracking-widest">Estética & Ergonomia Visual</span>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-textPrimary mt-1">Design System Noturno & Tabela WCAG 2.1</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-textSecondary">
      Paleta noturna em tom Verde-escuro profundo (<code>#091A13</code>), Marfim (<code>#F7F4EA</code>) e Amarelo (<code>#FACC15</code>), calibrada contra reflexos luminosos e aprovada em testes de acessibilidade.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
    <!-- Tokens Display Grid -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-surface p-6 rounded-2xl border border-borderSubtle space-y-4">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-textPrimary text-base mb-2">Tokens Cromáticos da Aplicação</h3>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <div class="w-full h-8 rounded bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle mb-2"></div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-textPrimary">Fundo Canvas</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-textSecondary">#091A13</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <div class="w-full h-8 rounded bg-surface border border-borderSubtle mb-2"></div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-textPrimary">Superfície Card</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-textSecondary">#132B22</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <div class="w-full h-8 rounded bg-textPrimary mb-2"></div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-canvas">Marfim (Ivory)</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-textSecondary">#F7F4EA</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <div class="w-full h-8 rounded bg-yellowAccent mb-2"></div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-yellowAccent">Amarelo / Gold</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-textSecondary">#FACC15</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <div class="w-full h-8 rounded bg-sageGreen mb-2"></div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-sageGreen">Verde Sage</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-textSecondary">#8CAE99</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <div class="w-full h-8 rounded bg-mintGreen mb-2"></div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-mintGreen">Verde Menta</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-textSecondary">#34D399</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-canvas border border-yellowAccent/30 text-xs text-textSecondary leading-relaxed">
        <strong class="text-yellowAccent">Conforto Óptico em Modo Escuro:</strong> O tom de Verde-escuro florestal elimina o cansaço visual comum do preto puro, oferecendo uma leitura suave do texto em cor Marfim com excelente separação de componentes.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- WCAG Contrast Matrix Table -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-surface p-6 rounded-2xl border border-borderSubtle">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-textPrimary text-base mb-2">Validação Luminotécnica (WCAG 2.1)</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-textSecondary mb-4">Medições de contraste contra o plano de fundo Verde-escuro (#091A13).</p>

      <div class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <span class="text-textPrimary font-sans">Texto Marfim (#F7F4EA)</span>
          <span class="text-mintGreen font-bold">16.8:1 (AAA)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <span class="text-textSecondary font-sans">Marfim Suave (#9CB0A3)</span>
          <span class="text-mintGreen font-bold">7.2:1 (AAA)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <span class="text-yellowAccent font-sans">Amarelo Destaque (#FACC15)</span>
          <span class="text-mintGreen font-bold">12.4:1 (AAA)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <span class="text-mintGreen font-sans">Verde Menta (#34D399)</span>
          <span class="text-mintGreen font-bold">9.1:1 (AAA)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-canvas border border-borderSubtle">
          <span class="text-terracotta font-sans">Terracota Alerta (#E05D43)</span>
          <span class="text-yellowAccent font-bold">4.8:1 (AA)</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
